# The Hub's image (deploy/hub/Dockerfile) is built from the framework's root with an allow-list: nothing goes in that
# is not named here. No instance data, no keys, no .env, no tests.
*
!package.json
!schemas
!scripts
!packages/admin
packages/admin/node_modules
packages/admin/tests
packages/admin/app/e2e
packages/admin/app/dist*
packages/admin/.env*
**/*.key
**/.env*
